# Client Logos Directory

This directory contains logos for client companies.

## Instructions:
1. Add client logos in PNG format (recommended 400x200px)
2. Name files appropriately (e.g., bang.png, itlifee.png)
3. Ensure logos are high quality and have transparent backgrounds

## Current Clients:
- bang.pk - https://bang.pk
- itlifee.net - https://itlifee.net

Add more client logos by placing PNG/SVG files in this directory.
